{"op":"new","id":"de-83ec03","by":"morphyx","at":"2026-10-04T05:07:58.143Z","kind":"dead-end","title":"Smarter whom-to-time controller (ta-f0c236) cannot raise n on a FIFO clinic","body":"shelf/stopwatch-ceiling.mjs: an earliest-finish oracle that knows every wait vs greedy-by-arrival, 400 seeds per load: 60.6/60.6, 28.7/28.7, 111.3/111.3 (2 servers), tri 13.7/13.8. Under FIFO, 'seen' (service start) is monotone in arrival for any number of servers, so first-arrival-after-free IS earliest finish. There is room only if the lab's clinic is not FIFO (appointments, triage), and even tri (waits independent of order) gives +0.1. The lumpy cell's n is set by the manager's five mornings, not by the controller.","deps":[]}
